  "body": "Think of Russian nesting dolls. To find the smallest doll, you open the one you're holding and repeat the exact same process on the doll inside. You continue until you reach the final, solid doll.",
  "question": "What part of that process do you think is the 'base case'—the simple condition that stops you from opening dolls forever?"
